20. Implement RefreshTokenService
21. Implement AuthService (register, login, logout)
22. Create AuthController with all endpoints

### Phase 6: Error Handling
23. Create custom exception classes
24. Implement GlobalExceptionHandler
25. Add validation error formatting

### Phase 7: Testing
26. Test registration endpoint
27. Test login endpoint
28. Test token refresh endpoint
29. Test logout endpoint
30. Test protected endpoints with valid/invalid tokens

